    "body": "I see, I didn't quite realize that ES's MapIterator/SetIterator had references to their creator Maps/Sets. It seems this could be fixable by patching ES to instead have them take a reference to their creator's [[MapData]]/[[SetData]], but I only did a quick scan of the spec.",
